    - target: {fileID: 4185366886401676623, guid: 36edad79980514fde91bbdaf000515b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Robots have transformed media by making complex camera movements precise,
        repeatable, and safe.

        Filmmaking drones can fly smoothly through
        tight spaces while stabilizing cameras in real time.

        They capture
        sweeping aerial shots, dynamic tracking scenes, and perspectives once impossible
        or dangerous for human operators.'
