    - target: {fileID: 4185366886401676623, guid: 36edad79980514fde91bbdaf000515b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Robots have increasingly entered the world of sports, where speed,
        control, and reaction time are critical.\nThis ping-pong robot, inspired
        by KUKA, uses cameras, sensors, and physics algorithms to track a ball in
        real time and respond in milliseconds. \nRobots in table tennis, basketball,
        and many other sports can calculate trajectories and execute precise movements
        much faster than human reflexes."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
