    - target: {fileID: 2035997823936950217, guid: 64e96864babe44084a28c2a4eb622e4a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Alongside Perserverance, Ingenuity became the first aircraft to achieve
        powered, controlled flight on another planet, proving that aerial exploration
        on Mars is possible.

        Together, they have revealed evidence of ancient
        lake environments and transformed how robots explore worlds.'
